863. METHANOTHERMOBACTER/METHANOBACTERIUM
     TRANSDUCTION MEDIUM


Basal salts solution                                          100.000       ml
Trace elements solution                                        10.000       ml
Sodium carbonate solution                                      24.000       ml
Cysteine solution                                               5.000       ml
Na2S solution                                                   5.000       ml
Degassed distilled H2O                                        856.000       ml

Anaerobically dispense liquid minimal medium in 10-ml portions into 100-ml serum vials
under an atmosphere of N2/CO2 (80:20). Seal vials with butyl rubber stoppers secured
with aluminium crimp seals. Sterilize by autoclaving for 15 minutes at 121C. Prior to
inoculation, pressurize bottles to 2 x 102 kPa with H2/CO2. For solidified plating medium,
add the following components per liter of liquid minimal medium:
 Agar                                                            15.000         g
 Titanium citrate solution                                       16.000        ml

Add titanium(III) citrate solution to warm (60C) agar medium after autoclaving. For
preparation of solidified agar medium.

Basal salts solution:
 KH2PO4                                                        68.000       g
 NH4Cl                                                         21.200       g
 Resazurin                                                     10.000      mg
 Distilled or deionized H2O                                  1000.000      ml

Trace elements solution:
 Nitrilotriacetic acid (Aldrich N8407)                          9.550        g
 MgCl2 x 6 H2O                                                  4.060        g
 FeCl2 x 4 H2O                                                  0.980        g
 NaWO4 x 6 H2O                                                  0.264        g
 NiCl2 x 6 H2O                                                  0.118        g
 Na2Se2O3                                                       0.100        g
 Na2MoO4 x 2 H2O                                                0.024        g
 CoCl2 x 6 H2O                                                  0.023        g
 Distilled or deionized H2O                                  1000.000       ml

Adjust pH of nitrilotriacetic acid in solution to 7.0 with KOH. Add minerals and adjust the
final pH to 7.0.
